# images.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with Impeller,
# against fl-engine's frame through emblema (docs/m3-status.md, Impeller
# parity). Percent of pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more
# than 32.
#
# Most cells differ by a level or two: JPEG decoded by zune-jpeg, not
# libjpeg-turbo; linear sampling's rounding; the translucent stripes'
# blend. Over 32: the checker at none, whose 17.5-pixel texels put square
# edges on pixel centers, and the photo crop's nearest texels. Measured
# 2026-10-30, lavapipe: 10.746% differ, 0.114% by more than 2, 0.039% by
# more than 32.
differ 12.0
differ_over_32 0.1
